 "notes": "Entity y = feet cell; ground top is row 10. The old oaks are the star: 4 giant oaks with long one-way limbs (rows 3-5) that link into one canopy highway x45-100 (gaps 1). Main path walks over the solid old buildings (hut, chapel + belfry, bungalow, cottage, carriage house, school room: steps <=2) and under the verandah/roof slabs; the Time Trail roofs (store verandah → parsonage → schoolmaster, gaps 3) are the cat route via posts and drainpipes. New tile J = in-ground bounce pad (see legend). Siamese replaced by tabby/persian until Enemy Studio recolours it. Kids are harmless NPCs (harmless:true, hitbox:false): no damage, no knock-back; hop over for a small coin bonus (bonus:'hop'). Fliers (magpie, wasp) only under open sky."
}